MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Books section: The Renewables Migration with its eleven public chapter
proof-engine repositories linked as chips — runnable code behind the
numbers, the same receipts discipline as the engineering — and The Orbital
AI Compute Roadmap, both honestly marked in revision. Ventures section:
Plastilonas Peruanas SAC and Ecowoods, the production platforms built and
run for real companies, with live and source links. Four locales.
---
 app/globals.css       | 14 ++++++++
 app/page.tsx          | 60 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 components/Chrome.tsx |  1 +
 lib/strings.json      | 84 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 4 files changed, 155 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/globals.css b/app/globals.css
index ccb0391..1a62417 100644
--- a/app/globals.css
+++ b/app/globals.css
@@ -136,3 +136,17 @@ footer { background: var(--ink); color: #f6efe4; border-radius: var(--sheet-r) v
 @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
   html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
 }
+
+/* ── Books ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
+.books { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
+.book { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r); padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .7rem; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(43,36,32,.04); }
+.book h3 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.3rem; }
+.book > p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.7; font-size: .95rem; }
+.proof { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: .9rem; margin-top: .3rem; }
+.proof-label { display: block; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: .6rem; }
+.proof-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem; }
+.proof-chips a { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 600; padding: .3rem .65rem; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--paper-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--ink); transition: border-color .15s ease, color .15s ease; }
+.proof-chips a:hover { border-color: var(--terra); color: var(--terra); }
+.grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
+.card-links { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
+@media (max-width: 980px) { .books, .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
